 22 expertly combines function with elegant design. This home features a double attached garage with a floor drain, 9’ ceilings on both the main and basement levels, and a separate side entrance. Durable Luxury Vinyl Plank flooring flows from the spacious foyer into an open-concept great room and kitchen, featuring Quartz countertops, a flush-ledge island, and premium soft-close cabinetry with a corner pantry.  The upper floor serves as a versatile family hub with a central bonus room and a dedicated laundry room. The primary suite is a standout retreat, offering a walk-in closet with a large window and a 4-piece ensuite with dual sinks and a glass shower. Two additional comfortable bedrooms and a full bath complete the level. Finished with modern black fixtures and upgraded railings, this model is as stylish as it is practical. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$534,600"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,639 sq ft"],["Year built","2025"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","River's Edge"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6M3E8"],["MLS® number","E4502815"],["Listed","August 8, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Microwave Range Hood Combo, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.81 m × 3.83 m (15'9\" × 12'7\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.67 m × 2.67 m (8'9\" × 8'9\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.90 m × 2.63 m (12'10\" × 8'8\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","3.98 m × 3.50 m (13'1\" × 11'6\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","4.90 m × 2.86 m (16'1\" × 9'5\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.57 m × 3.44 m (11'9\" × 11'3\")"],["Bonus Room","Upper Level","2.76 m × 3.33 m (9'1\" × 10'11\")"]],"courtesy":"David Lam, Exp Realty and Joe Tolvay, Exp Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"river-s-edge","area":"west-edmonton"}